      {
        "id": "KSanteQ",
        "name": "Ntofo Strikes",
        "description": "K'Sante strikes, damaging and slowing enemies in a short line.<br><br>On hit, grants a stack of Ntofo Strikes. At 2 stacks, K'Sante fires a shockwave that pulls enemies in.<br><br>When All Out, cooldown is reduced.",
        "tooltip": "K'Sante slams his weapon, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(70/100/130/160/190 + (40% bonus Armor) + (40% bonus Magic Resist)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies by 80% for 0.5s. If he hits, he gains a stack of Ntofo Strikes for 6 seconds. At 2 stacks, he instead fires a shockwave that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stuns</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Pulls</span> enemies for 1 second.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">All Out</span>: Cooldown is reduced by 33%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Cooldown & cast time reduced by Bonus <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Armor</span> and <span>Magic Resist</span>: / 120.</span>",
