      {
        "id": "KSanteW",
        "name": "Path Maker",
        "description": "K'Sante charges up, taking reduced damage, then dashes, knocking back and stunning enemies.<br><br>When All Out, deals increased damage and no longer knocks back or stuns.",
        "tooltip": "K'Sante raises his weapons defensively for 0.4-1.0s, becoming Unstoppable and reducing incoming damage by 30%. Then, he rams forward, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">45/75/105/135/165 + (8% + (0.02% bonus Armor) + (0.02% bonus Magic Resist)) max Health physical damage</span>. Enemies hit are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Back</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> for 0.5-1.75s (based on charge time).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">All Out:</span> Cooldown is refreshed. Deals an additional 10-80% damage as <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">true damage</span> (based on charge time), damage reduction is increased to 75% and dash speed is increased, but no longer <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Back</span> or <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stuns</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Maximum effect is reached at 90% charge time.<br />Maximum of 180/260/340/420/500 damage against monsters.</span>",
